nwep-by-yeoldelaptopsposse for Debian
------------------------------------

Changes from the original intro:

 * ported from SDL 1.2 to SDL2, starts in a window;
 * the window is resizable, F toggles fullscreen (desktop resolution);
   the intro is still rendered at 1280x720 and scaled with letterboxing;
 * V-Sync is enabled;
 * Esc or closing the window quits.

The 4klang synthesizer (music/4klang.asm) is 32-bit x86 assembly: the
package is only built for i386. It uses absolute addressing, so the
executable is linked without PIE (hardening-no-pie lintian override).

Shaders are pre-minified in debian/patches/07_update_minified_shaders.patch,
because shader_minifier.exe needs mono, which is not available on every
build target. To regenerate them (mono-runtime needed):

  quilt push 07_update_minified_shaders.patch
  make shaders
  quilt refresh -p ab --no-timestamps
  quilt pop -a

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

